# Send only the Docker metadata and the runtime Python package. This keeps
# local evidence, tests, docs, GUI scripts, and development caches out of the
# build context. Do not add a broad binary-file rule: the bundled data files in
# mountfile/data/ are runtime package data for the RT809 decoder.
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!docker-compose.yml
!mountfile/
!mountfile/**

# Re-apply common generated-file exclusions after re-including the package.
mountfile/**/__pycache__/
mountfile/**/*.py[cod]
